flowchart LR
    Classic["<b>Classic tc-bpf attach</b><br/><b>does:</b> create clsact qdisc, add tc filter, run filters by priority<br/><b>handoff:</b> packet path walks qdisc-owned filter state<br/><b>state:</b> attachment is owned by tc objects and must be deleted explicitly"]

    TCX["<b>tcx attach</b><br/><b>does:</b> attach BPF program directly to ingress/egress tcx hook<br/><b>handoff:</b> kernel returns a bpf_link fd for ownership and ordering<br/><b>state:</b> link close detaches, mprog flags control before/after/replace order"]

    Packet["<b>packet verdict</b><br/>both paths run on skb at tc ingress/egress<br/><b>state:</b> program verdict can pass, drop, redirect, or continue"]

    Classic --> Packet
    TCX --> Packet

    classDef old fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,stroke-width:2px
    classDef new fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef pkt fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
    class Classic old
    class TCX new
    class Packet pkt
